{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 38,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of David, to bring to remembrance. O LORD, rebuke me not in thy wrath: neither chasten me in thy hot displeasure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thy arrows stick fast in me, and thy hand falleth heavy upon me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no soundness in my flesh because of thy anger; neither ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is there any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " rest in my bones because of my sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For my iniquities have gone over my head: as a heavy burden they are too heavy for me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My wounds are offensive, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are corrupt because of my foolishness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am troubled; I am bowed down greatly; I go mourning all the day long.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For my loins are filled with a lothsome ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "disease",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no soundness in my flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am feeble and grievously broken: I have roared by reason of the disquietness of my heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "LORD, all my desire ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before thee; and my groaning is not hid from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My heart panteth, my strength faileth me: as for the light of my eyes, that also is gone from me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My lovers and my friends stand aloof from my affliction; and my kinsmen stand afar off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They also that seek after my life lay snares ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and they that seek my hurt speak mischievous things, and imagine deceits all the day long.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I, as a deaf ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", heard not; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as a dumb man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " openeth not his mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus I was as a man that heareth not, and in whose mouth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no reproofs.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For in thee, O LORD, do I hope: thou wilt hear, O LORD my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I said, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", lest ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "otherwise",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they should rejoice over me: when my foot slippeth, they magnify ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "themselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ready to halt, and my sorrow ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " continually before me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I will declare my iniquity; I will be sorry for my sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But my enemies ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lively, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they are strong: and they that hate me wrongfully are multiplied.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They also that render evil for good are my adversaries; because I follow ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the thing that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forsake me not, O LORD: O my God, be not far from me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.38.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Make haste to help me, O LORD my salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
